			"text": "## [The Assembly of Accord](../factions/the-assembly-of-accord)\n\n**Leader:** Lord Arbitrator Hadrian Voss  \n**Goal:** Establish lasting international frameworks  \n\n[→ Read more](../factions/the-assembly-of-accord)"
