			"text": "## [The Gray Corsairs](../factions/the-gray-corsairs)\n\n**Leader:** Captain Isla Stormwright  \n**Goal:** Prevent colonial exploitation  \n\n[→ Read more](../factions/the-gray-corsairs)"
